    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New puzzler from the creators of &quot;Klocki&quot;, &quot;Zenge&quot;, &quot;Hook&quot; and &quot;Art of Gravity&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like our previous games, its intended to be a relaxing experience, thus there are no points, stars, tutorials, move counters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to push all the buttons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How do you do it? Well, thats the puzzle...</p>",
